[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21780.788, "timestamp": "06:03:00", "text": "嗯，剛才是什麼來著？我想，應該是洗手間吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21782.51, "timestamp": "06:03:02", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21795.59, "timestamp": "06:03:15", "text": "我該怎麼辦？然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21797.59, "timestamp": "06:03:17", "text": "30人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21798.19, "timestamp": "06:03:18", "text": "30"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21801.43, "timestamp": "06:03:21", "text": "使用者少於 100 人的伺服器，或最常見的伺服器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21802.99, "timestamp": "06:03:22", "text": "啊，沒錯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21803.35, "timestamp": "06:03:23", "text": "40"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21805.43, "timestamp": "06:03:25", "text": "如果你這樣做，它很可能會在你進入的那一刻就開始運行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21812.868, "timestamp": "06:03:32", "text": "或許是因為哈佩回來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21815.51, "timestamp": "06:03:35", "text": "是的。"}]